# Environment variables
#
# This Astro portfolio is a static site. No API keys, tokens, or secrets
# are required for local development or production builds.
#
# Site URL, SEO, and contact details live in source:
#   - src/seo/config.ts
#   - src/content/site.ts
#
# If you later add a private integration, put secrets in GitHub Actions
# repository secrets (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions)
# and reference them as ${{ secrets.NAME }} — never commit real values here.
